                                                "sense_id": "d3009ce4-2b5d-3b6d-8c6e-95c4c6c83b1d",
                                                "text": "It would be wholly misplaced to assess the Yeltsinian wager through the prism of our own Jeffersonian democracy."
                                            }
                                        ]
